  "version": "0.11.0-alpha.6",
  "notes": "## 0.11.0-alpha.6 - 2026-05-23\n\n### Features\n\n- Update paired device online status faster when a device comes back online, while reducing background traffic from the Devices page (#831)\n- Refresh the desktop app icon with new artwork (#832)\n- Add a cancel action for incoming file transfers and new CLI commands to send and receive files (#833)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Make large file transfers more reliable by stopping timed-out or cancelled receives, showing cancellations separately from failures, keeping sender progress accurate until the real file finishes, and preventing progress updates from slowing down the app (#833)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.11.0-alpha.6 - 2026-05-23\n\n### Features\n\n- 设备重新上线时，已配对设备的在线状态更新更快，同时减少设备页面带来的后台网络流量 (#831)\n- 更新桌面应用图标，使用新的图标设计 (#832)\n- 为传入的文件传输增加取消操作，并新增用于发送和接收文件的 CLI 命令 (#833)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 提升大文件传输的可靠性：超时或取消接收后会停止传输，取消状态会与失败区分显示，发送端进度会等实际文件完成后再结束，并避免进度更新拖慢应用 (#833)",
